[
  {
    "section": "fate",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 210\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig1-title fig1-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig1-title\">Normal fate is not the full potential</title><desc id=\"fig1-desc\">Hypothetical progenitor: its normal environment supports epidermis; an alternative environment can support a neural outcome. This is not a claim about any specific species.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"105\" r=\"22\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"110\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >P</text><line x1=\"108\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow1)\"/><line x1=\"108\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow1)\"/><rect x=\"268\" y=\"31\" width=\"220\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"#76bc9a\"/><text x=\"378\" y=\"59\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Normal: epidermis</text><rect x=\"268\" y=\"133\" width=\"220\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"#75b4e5\"/><text x=\"378\" y=\"161\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Graft: neural</text><text x=\"85\" y=\"150\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Progenitor</text> </svg><figcaption>Figure 1. Normal fate is not the full potential. Hypothetical progenitor: its normal environment supports epidermis; an alternative environment can support a neural outcome. This is not a claim about any specific species.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
  },
  {
    "section": "maps",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 252\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig2-title fig2-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig2-title\">Spatial fate map and later tissue arrangement</title><desc id=\"fig2-desc\">A conceptual embryo cross-section, not a species-specific anatomical map. The colored source regions have later derivatives; the yellow territory moves inward.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow2\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><ellipse cx=\"120\" cy=\"115\" rx=\"80\" ry=\"90\" fill=\"#75b4e5\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M49 145 Q120 101 191 145 Q175 205 120 205 Q65 205 49 145Z\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"405\" cy=\"115\" rx=\"75\" ry=\"90\" fill=\"#75b4e5\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"405\" cy=\"125\" rx=\"34\" ry=\"50\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"204\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"323\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow2)\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"17\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Early</text><text x=\"405\" y=\"17\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Later</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"232\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Surface source</text><text x=\"405\" y=\"232\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Internal derivative</text> </svg><figcaption>Figure 2. Spatial fate map and later tissue arrangement. A conceptual embryo cross-section, not a species-specific anatomical map. The colored source regions have later derivatives; the yellow territory moves inward.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
  },
  {
    "section": "trees",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 278\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig3-title fig3-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig3-title\">Lineage tree with unequal daughter outcomes</title><desc id=\"fig3-desc\">A divides into B and C. The four terminal descendants show two epidermal cells, a neuron and a glial cell. Branch lengths are not time-scaled.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow3\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"35\" r=\"22\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"40\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >A</text><line x1=\"247\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"149\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"273\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"371\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"120\" r=\"22\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"125\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >B</text><circle cx=\"390\" cy=\"120\" r=\"22\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"125\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >C</text><line x1=\"117\" y1=\"139\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"144\" y1=\"139\" x2=\"193\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"377\" y1=\"139\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"404\" y1=\"139\" x2=\"453\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><circle cx=\"55\" cy=\"216\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#76bc9a\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"221\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >E</text><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"216\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#76bc9a\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"221\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >E</text><circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"216\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#75b4e5\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"221\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >N</text><circle cx=\"465\" cy=\"216\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#c1a5e8\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"465\" y=\"221\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >G</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"262\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >E = epidermal</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"262\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >N = neuron; G = glia</text> </svg><figcaption>Figure 3. Lineage tree with unequal daughter outcomes. A divides into B and C. The four terminal descendants show two epidermal cells, a neuron and a glial cell. Branch lengths are not time-scaled.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
  },
  {
    "section": "observation",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 180\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig4-title fig4-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig4-title\">Continuous observations distinguish cell identities</title><desc id=\"fig4-desc\">Three hypothetical frames show two cells exchanging relative positions; the same marker follows identity rather than the side of the frame.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow4\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"15\" y=\"38\" width=\"130\" height=\"100\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"22\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Frame 1</text><rect x=\"195\" y=\"38\" width=\"130\" height=\"100\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"22\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Frame 2</text><rect x=\"375\" y=\"38\" width=\"130\" height=\"100\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"440\" y=\"22\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Frame 3</text><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"86\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"91\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >A</text><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"86\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#75b4e5\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"91\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >B</text><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"62\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"67\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >A</text><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"115\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#75b4e5\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"120\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >B</text><circle cx=\"470\" cy=\"86\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"91\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >A</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"86\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#75b4e5\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"91\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >B</text><line x1=\"148\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow4)\"/><line x1=\"328\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow4)\"/> </svg><figcaption>Figure 4. Continuous observations distinguish cell identities. Three hypothetical frames show two cells exchanging relative positions; the same marker follows identity rather than the side of the frame.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
  },
  {
    "section": "dyes",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig5-title fig5-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig5-title\">Vital-dye tracing and marker leakage</title><desc id=\"fig5-desc\">The upper example retains a local marker among descendants; the lower example shows spread into unrelated cells. Letter L identifies the original lineage.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow5\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"95\" y=\"18\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >At labeling</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"18\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >At endpoint</text><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"62\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"67\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >L</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"62\" r=\"18\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow5)\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"62\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"67\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >L</text><circle cx=\"388\" cy=\"62\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"388\" y=\"67\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >L</text><circle cx=\"436\" cy=\"62\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"104\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Retained</text><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"153\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"158\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >L</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"153\" r=\"18\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"153\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"153\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow5)\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"153\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"158\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >L</text><circle cx=\"388\" cy=\"153\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"388\" y=\"158\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >L</text><circle cx=\"436\" cy=\"153\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"158\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >?</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"200\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Leakage: false positive</text> </svg><figcaption>Figure 5. Vital-dye tracing and marker leakage. The upper example retains a local marker among descendants; the lower example shows spread into unrelated cells. Letter L identifies the original lineage.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
  },
  {
    "section": "fluorescence",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 280\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig6-title fig6-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig6-title\">Tracer dilution versus division number</title><desc id=\"fig6-desc\">Hypothetical integrated signal: 640 units initially, halved at each division. A threshold of 20 units is met at division 5; division 6 is below detection.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow6\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"485\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"39.400000000000006\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><text x=\"75\" y=\"246\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >0</text><circle cx=\"141\" cy=\"132.2\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><text x=\"141\" y=\"246\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >1</text><circle cx=\"207\" cy=\"178.6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><text x=\"207\" y=\"246\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >2</text><circle cx=\"273\" cy=\"201.8\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><text x=\"273\" y=\"246\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >3</text><circle cx=\"339\" cy=\"213.4\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><text x=\"339\" y=\"246\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >4</text><circle cx=\"405\" cy=\"219.2\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><text x=\"405\" y=\"246\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >5</text><circle cx=\"471\" cy=\"222.1\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><text x=\"471\" y=\"246\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >6</text><polyline points=\"75,39.400000000000006 141,132.2 207,178.6 273,201.8 339,213.4 405,219.2 471,222.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"219.2\" x2=\"485\" y2=\"219.2\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"268\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Division number</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"123\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 28 123)\">Signal</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"30\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >640</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"205\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >20 threshold</text> </svg><figcaption>Figure 6. Tracer dilution versus division number. Hypothetical integrated signal: 640 units initially, halved at each division. A threshold of 20 units is met at division 5; division 6 is below detection.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
  },
  {
    "section": "grafts",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig7-title fig7-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig7-title\">Orthotopic versus heterotopic transplantation</title><desc id=\"fig7-desc\">A marked donor patch is placed at its equivalent host location (top) or a different location (bottom). Only the second alters regional context.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow7\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"115\" r=\"64\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"76\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"402\" cy=\"65\" r=\"45\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"402\" cy=\"40\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><circle cx=\"402\" cy=\"177\" r=\"45\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"402\" cy=\"202\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\"/><line x1=\"157\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"353\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow7)\"/><line x1=\"157\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"353\" y2=\"177\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow7)\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"200\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Donor</text><text x=\"267\" y=\"58\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Same site</text><text x=\"267\" y=\"194\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Different site</text> </svg><figcaption>Figure 7. Orthotopic versus heterotopic transplantation. A marked donor patch is placed at its equivalent host location (top) or a different location (bottom). Only the second alters regional context.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
  },
  {
    "section": "conklin",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 245\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig8-title fig8-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig8-title\">Ascidian primary muscle precursor pair</title><desc id=\"fig8-desc\">Stylized bilateral eight-cell embryo in two tiers. The posterior vegetal B4.1 pair is highlighted; only the primary muscle contribution is indicated, not the complete fate map.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow8\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"95\" y=\"20\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Anterior</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"20\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Posterior</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"65\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" text-anchor=\"start\">Animal</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"151\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" text-anchor=\"start\">Vegetal</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"63\" r=\"24\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"63\" r=\"24\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"63\" r=\"24\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"365\" cy=\"63\" r=\"24\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"150\" r=\"24\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"150\" r=\"24\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"150\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"155\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >B4.1</text><circle cx=\"365\" cy=\"150\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"365\" y=\"155\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >B4.1</text><line x1=\"337\" y1=\"177\" x2=\"337\" y2=\"207\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow8)\"/><text x=\"337\" y=\"230\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Primary tail muscle contribution</text> </svg><figcaption>Figure 8. Ascidian primary muscle precursor pair. Stylized bilateral eight-cell embryo in two tiers. The posterior vegetal B4.1 pair is highlighted; only the primary muscle contribution is indicated, not the complete fate map.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
  },
  {
    "section": "worm",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figure-panel\" data-figure=\"9\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 340\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"fig9-title fig9-desc\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title id=\"fig9-title\">Early C. elegans founder lineage</title><desc id=\"fig9-desc\">Simplified genealogy of P0, AB, EMS, P2, P3 and P4; later somatic branches are omitted. Branches encode parentage, not elapsed time.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow9\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"265\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"265\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"480\" y1=\"265\" x2=\"445\" y2=\"315\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><line x1=\"480\" y1=\"265\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"315\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"30\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"35\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >P0</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"85\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"90\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >AB</text><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"85\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"90\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >P1</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"145\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"150\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >EMS</text><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"145\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"150\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >P2</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"205\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"210\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >MS</text><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"205\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#d8a342\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"210\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >E</text><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"205\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"210\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >C</text><circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"205\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"210\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >P3</text><circle cx=\"390\" cy=\"265\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"270\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >D</text><circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"265\" r=\"19\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"270\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >P4</text><circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"315\" r=\"14\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"445\" y=\"320\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Z2</text><circle cx=\"505\" cy=\"315\" r=\"14\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"505\" y=\"320\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" >Z3</text> </svg><figcaption>Figure 9. Early C. elegans founder lineage. Simplified genealogy of P0, AB, EMS, P2, P3 and P4; later somatic branches are omitted. Branches encode parentage, not elapsed time.</figcaption><button type=\"button\" class=\"tool-btn figure-zoom\">Enlarge diagram</button></figure>"
